  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, combine the water (for the couscous) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b12871fda05b1d5f95f05-1b370d6f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a medium bowl, place cucumber, snacking tomatoes, green dressing and a drizzle of olive oil. Tear over parsley. Season with salt and pepper and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b12871fda05b1d5f95f05-ddfb7623.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook chickpeas, tossing, until tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add garlic & herb seasoning and tomato paste and cook, stirring until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in the water (for the chickpeas) and simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b12871fda05b1d5f95f05-61caa975.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide couscous between bowls.\n• Top with chickpeas and Greek salad.\n• Crumble over fetta cubes to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b12871fda05b1d5f95f05-6880fa45.jpeg"
    }
  ]
